                                                "sense_id": "fbfb9e99-652a-3616-9937-f601dcd03c7d",
                                                "text": "In ways, these people defined what it was to be a really good lesbian or a really good dyke. For example: You needed to be articulate or aggressive […] You either needed to be a university or community college person, or a real sincere and hardworking blue collar. If you were from one of the outlying towns, you were likely to have a black mark against you in the first place."
                                            }
